---
// ICDL România — Centru de Testare Acreditat
// Replaces old PartnersSection. Shows official ICDL logo only.
---

<section
  id="icdl-centru"
  class="relative py-14 md:py-20"
  style="background: #FAFAF8; border-top: 1px solid #D9D6D1;"
  aria-labelledby="icdl-centru-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 text-center">

    <p
      id="icdl-centru-heading"
      class="text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase mb-10 md:mb-12"
      style="color: #AAA39A; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;"
    >
      Centru de Testare Acreditat ICDL
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://icdl.ro/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="Centru de Testare Acreditat ICDL – BlankSpace Brașov. Deschide site-ul oficial ICDL România."
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-80 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#B8A22A] focus-visible:ring-offset-4 rounded-xl"
      id="icdl-logo-link"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/icdl/centru-testare-acreditat-icdl.svg"
        alt="Centru de Testare Acreditat ICDL – BlankSpace Brașov"
        class="icdl-logo"
        loading="lazy"
        width="172"
        height="168"
      />
    </a>

    <p class="mt-8 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl mx-auto" style="color: #5A5A5A; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
      BlankSpace este centru de testare acreditat ICDL în Brașov. Certificatele ICDL sunt recunoscute internațional în peste 100 de țări.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .icdl-logo {
    max-width: 200px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .icdl-logo {
      max-width: 240px;
    }
  }
</style>
